      "jcr:created": "Mon Jun 08 2020 17:06:57 GMT+0000",
      "text": "<p>By the end of the challenge, Kenneth had taken <span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">over one million steps in support of heroes on the front lines</span></span>. That’s the equivalent of nearly 18 marathons in a single month!</p>\n<p>Ken’s passion and dedication is another example of people helping people during these challenging times. You can read more stories <a href=\"https://www.stryker.com/us/en/about/news/features/people-helping-people.html\">here</a>.</p>\n",
